ntial part of the process automation in rolling mills to improve the produc=
t quality and to reduce scrap metal and costs. A contactless and nondestruc=
tive measuring method is using an encircling pass-through coil as an eddy-c=
urrent sensor. This rather simple method allows measuring the cross-section=
al area of a hot <a class=3D"nova-legacy-e-link nova-legacy-e-link--color-b=
